# Nanbeige4.3-33B's first prompt rows on the A6000. A prompt token costs 2 x ~32.5e9 multiply-adds over the trunk's
# weights [derived from the tensor census: 20.78 GB at Q4_K_M ~4.9 bits a weight ~ 33.9e9 weights]: 67.8 GFLOP. The
# dense FFN and projections run the K-quant tensor-core GEMM; at 40..55 % of the A6000's 154.8 TFLOPS f16 roof
# (62..85 TFLOPS) that is 0.80..1.09 ms a token; the group-of-7 prompt flash at P = 4096 adds ~10 % [derived:
# 2 x 56 heads x 128 x P/2 per token per layer]. pp512 ~920..1250 tok/s, pp4096 ~840..1140.
kind: baseline
